{"product_id":"iqos-terea-mulint-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Mulint Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Cigarette Mulint Edition: Mint and mulberry scent combined with cloves.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Mulint Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. Users can use the product within 6 minutes. That is, users can use it with 14 continuous puffs. However, this number is only an estimate because each person will have a different time to inhale the cigarette. However, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea Indonesia cigarette\"\u003eTerea Indonesia cigarettes \u003c\/a\u003eare still highly appreciated in terms of dosage and usage time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe product will appeal to users who love unusual flavour solutions. Moderately sweet and refreshing, it is perfectly complemented by quality Indonesian tobacco. We offer original high-quality sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764580130871,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764580163639,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-cigarette-Mulint-Edition.webp?v=1751934515","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-mulint-edition","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




